<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss H1 company bankruptcies rise 8.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Swiss H1 company bankruptcies rise 8.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ST GALLEN, Switzerland 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss commercial bankruptcies rose 8.2 percent from January until end-June compared with the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>Schweizerischer Verband Creditreform, a bureau that gives banks information on the creditworthiness of borrowers, said 2,197 commercial bankruptcy proceedings had been registered in the first five months of the year. It did not provide the number for the comparative 1996 period.</p>
<p>Including non-firm bankruptcy proceedings, total bankruptcy cases fell 1.3 percent to 4,683.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
